        "description": "USN-5488-1 fixed vulnerabilities in OpenSSL. This update provides the corresponding updates for Ubuntu 16.04 ESM.  Original advisory details:   Chancen and Daniel Fiala discovered that OpenSSL incorrectly handled the  c_rehash script. A local attacker could possibly use this issue to execute  arbitrary commands when c_rehash is run.",
